OL,3,GNEWSAHomelessness charity calls for
OL,4,Asustainable funding
OL,5,
OL,6,FA homelessness charity says it may have
OL,7,Fto make redundancies and reduce its
OL,8,Fservices amidst financial challenges.
OL,10,FManna House, in Kendal, Cumbria, said
OL,11,Fthe situation had been caused by a
OL,12,Fdecline in grant funding and donations
OL,13,Fcombined with higher running costs.
OL,15,FIt needs #1,000 a day to meet demand
OL,16,Fand said it does about 28 loads of
OL,17,Fwashing every week and provides a
OL,18,Fsimilar number of showers, contributing
OL,19,Fto spiralling energy costs.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
