OL,3,GNEWSAHomelessness charity calls for
OL,4,Asustainable funding
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt also said government funding to
OL,7,Ftackle homelessness should be received
OL,8,Fto help put it on a sustainable
OL,9,Ffooting. The charity's chief officer
OL,10,FAndrea Aldridge said it needed
OL,11,Fguaranteed funds to do the "really good
OL,12,Fwork we do".
